1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:02,240
This series was created
for entertainment purposes.

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:05,680
The characters, actions, locations,
dialogue, languages, ceremonies,

3
00:00:05,680 --> 00:00:08,120
and artistic elements depicted in this series

4
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:10,040
are fictional and based on imagination,

5
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:13,920
incorporating the beauty
of the region's diverse cultures,

6
00:00:13,920 --> 00:00:18,400
including those
of Lanna, Myanmar, the Tai peoples, and China.

7
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,560
It is not intended to disrespect any history,

8
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:23,600
ethnic group, organization, profession,
or group of individuals.

9
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:26,040
Viewer discretion is advised.

10
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:28,640
[Previously]
Why must I keep an eye on Fongnuan?

11
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:31,600
She's only a lady-in-waiting.
She hardly seems dangerous.

12
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:33,080
I don't trust her.

13
00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:34,640
Under the circumstances,

14
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:38,440
I'm sure you know
what you should and shouldn't say.

15
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:40,680
I've learned
about Maneethip and General In Saeng.

16
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:44,080
Kong Tai has met the woman of his dreams.
She's Muen In's daughter.

17
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:46,640
If you keep working all the time,
when will you find a wife?

18
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:49,720
If I had to choose
between falling in love and catching bandits,

19
00:00:49,720 --> 00:00:51,000
I'd rather hunt bandits.

20
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:52,160
From this day forward,

21
00:00:52,160 --> 00:00:55,160
I'll do everything I can
to take good care of Maneethip.

22
00:00:55,160 --> 00:00:59,920
Let's do everything we can for her
and help her get well as soon as possible.

23
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:01,440
Shall we?

24
00:01:05,720 --> 00:01:07,760
Boon's at another meeting?

25
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:13,640
Yes. She said it was urgent.
And really important.

26
00:01:14,840 --> 00:01:16,920
What's more important than her own mom?

27
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:22,360
Making money to pay for her mom's treatment.

28
00:01:22,360 --> 00:01:24,880
That's important too, Bew.

29
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:29,320
I'm sorry, ma'am.

30
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:36,280
Boon has a lot of bills to pay.

31
00:01:36,280 --> 00:01:42,240
She's a freelancer,
so she has to take whatever jobs she can get.

32
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:46,200
But I'm free today,
so I came to help look after her mom.

33
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:52,360
Eva, you're such a good friend to Boon.

34
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:58,000
Boon's always there for me
whenever I need help.

35
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:02,840
I think Boon's the lucky one
to have a friend like you.

36
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:09,360
And I think Boon's lucky
to have a boyfriend like you.

37
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:14,240
I hope she thinks so too.

38
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:19,600
I've barely seen her all month.
I see you more often than her.

39
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:24,680
I've got an idea.
Could you teach me therapeutic massage?

40
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:28,680
Then if you're busy next time,
I can come and do it myself.

41
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:31,080
Are you sure? It's not that easy.

42
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:33,440
I'm sure. I want to help.

43
00:02:34,920 --> 00:02:39,080
All right, then. Stand over there.
Let me adjust the bed first.

44
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:42,240
I'll adjust it for you, ma'am.

45
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:48,840
Make a triangle with your hands and press down.

46
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:50,760
Hold for three seconds each time.

47
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:27,000
Thanks for driving me home.

48
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:28,320
No problem.

49
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:35,800
Thanks, Bew. Here you go.

50
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:38,800
No, I've got it. Where should I put these?

51
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:41,360
On that table over there.

52
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:49,680
Thanks.

53
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:01,040
Eva.

54
00:04:01,040 --> 00:04:04,880
Got anything to drink that'll wake me up?
I'm too sleepy to drive home.

55
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:09,520
I've got this.

56
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:13,440
Thanks.

57
00:04:21,520 --> 00:04:24,360
How is it? Feeling more awake?

58
00:04:26,400 --> 00:04:28,200
That's refreshing.

59
00:04:41,960 --> 00:04:43,520
Thank you.

60
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:10,240
[Love Amulet]

61
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:25,800
Cousin, it's time to eat.

62
00:07:30,400 --> 00:07:32,320
Careful, my lady. It's still hot.

63
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:57,120
Fongnuan.

64
00:07:57,760 --> 00:07:59,440
I want to sleep.

65
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:39,760
How is Maneethip today?

66
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:44,400
She's barely eaten anything.

67
00:08:44,400 --> 00:08:50,600
The healer says
her illness isn't just from not eating.

68
00:08:50,600 --> 00:08:53,400
Her grief is taking a toll on her, too.

69
00:08:58,920 --> 00:09:01,360
When we love someone...

70
00:09:03,680 --> 00:09:06,200
and see them suffer,

71
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:09,640
we suffer with them.

72
00:09:11,240 --> 00:09:14,960
When they're in pain, we feel their pain.

73
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:17,920
And when they die,

74
00:09:19,680 --> 00:09:21,920
a part of us dies with them.

75
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:33,920
I know that feeling all too well.

76
00:09:33,920 --> 00:09:35,920
If she goes on like this,

77
00:09:35,920 --> 00:09:40,080
I'm afraid she won't be able
to endure it, Your Highness.

78
00:09:46,520 --> 00:09:51,560
I've heard that wild negkassar flowers
have cooling medicinal properties.

79
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:56,680
They help restore strength and ease fatigue,
and stimulate the appetite.

80
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:59,080
I'll gather some to make medicine
for Maneethip.

81
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:01,000
I'd like to come with you.

82
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:07,560
But wild Negkassar flowers
grow high in the mountains.

83
00:10:07,560 --> 00:10:11,800
The path is dangerous, my lady.
I'll go, no matter how dangerous it is.

84
00:10:13,520 --> 00:10:17,760
I want to help my cousin.
Please let me come with you.

85
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:32,440
Lha, take good care of Maneethip.

86
00:10:32,440 --> 00:10:34,280
I'll return as soon as I can.

87
00:10:34,280 --> 00:10:35,840
Yes, Your Highness.

88
00:10:35,840 --> 00:10:38,840
Please take care of Lady Fongnuan.

89
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:29,960
I'm fine.

90
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:54,800
Are you all right?

91
00:13:05,760 --> 00:13:09,960
I'm fine, Your Highness. I'm sorry.

92
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:12,280
Let's hurry.

93
00:13:12,280 --> 00:13:15,440
Rest for a while. You look exhausted.

94
00:13:16,280 --> 00:13:19,000
I assure you, I'm fine.

95
00:13:20,640 --> 00:13:25,080
Let's keep going. I'm worried about Maneethip.

96
00:13:25,840 --> 00:13:29,760
You're not in the best of health yourself.
A little rest will do you good.

97
00:13:29,760 --> 00:13:32,000
We can continue once you've rested.

98
00:13:34,280 --> 00:13:36,840
Your cousin cares deeply about you.

99
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:39,640
If you fall ill too,

100
00:13:39,640 --> 00:13:44,920
no medicine in the world could help her.

101
00:13:44,920 --> 00:13:47,520
She'd be too worried about you.

102
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:05,920
Come, sit down and rest.

103
00:14:28,840 --> 00:14:31,200
Are you tired, Your Highness?

104
00:14:37,160 --> 00:14:39,760
I already told you...

105
00:14:39,760 --> 00:14:42,880
I'd do everything I can
to take care of Maneethip.

106
00:14:44,880 --> 00:14:47,760
No amount of exhaustion will stop me.

107
00:14:51,120 --> 00:14:56,720
Your cousin must be a hundred times
more exhausted and miserable than I am.

108
00:14:57,840 --> 00:15:03,120
Though she can't be with the man she loves,
her love for him has never faded.

109
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:12,720
Even I feel upset at times.

110
00:15:13,760 --> 00:15:15,760
Sometimes I can't help feeling jealous.

111
00:15:18,920 --> 00:15:24,640
Maneethip and General In Saeng's love
has brought them so much pain.

112
00:15:25,760 --> 00:15:31,760
I believe my cousin knows
your feelings are sincere,

113
00:15:33,240 --> 00:15:36,760
and how deeply you care for her.

114
00:15:36,760 --> 00:15:38,840
You're the only one who understands.

115
00:15:44,800 --> 00:15:48,760
Fongnuan, you have my word.

116
00:15:49,440 --> 00:15:54,720
Whatever the future holds,
I'll devote the rest of my life...

117
00:15:55,920 --> 00:15:59,480
to caring for you and your cousin
as best I can.

118
00:15:59,480 --> 00:16:05,480
You both had to travel so far from home
because of me.

119
00:16:06,680 --> 00:16:11,520
I'll do whatever it takes
to spare you both any more sorrow.

120
00:16:13,680 --> 00:16:15,400
I promise.

121
00:16:27,160 --> 00:16:28,960
Thank you, Your Highness.

122
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:35,520
I feel better now. Shall we continue?

123
00:17:17,800 --> 00:17:23,480
He's gone? In this pouring rain?
When did he leave?

124
00:17:30,560 --> 00:17:33,720
None of my children ever meet my expectations.

125
00:17:38,160 --> 00:17:41,000
- Take it outside to dry in the sun.
- Yes, my lady.

126
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:42,920
- Lady Homjan.
- Your Highness.

127
00:17:42,920 --> 00:17:44,440
May I lie down?

128
00:17:45,400 --> 00:17:47,240
Of course.

129
00:18:05,600 --> 00:18:08,480
You're being unusually affectionate.
What do you want, Your Highness?

130
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:14,320
Nothing. I just came to ask you something.

131
00:18:14,320 --> 00:18:19,960
Is it true a troupe is coming to
teach the ladies-in-waiting to dance?

132
00:18:20,640 --> 00:18:24,080
That's right. Why do you ask?

133
00:18:25,040 --> 00:18:30,240
Wouldn't it be nice
if they could learn music as well?

134
00:18:31,000 --> 00:18:35,360
Why do you want
the ladies-in-waiting to learn music?

135
00:18:35,360 --> 00:18:37,720
I've noticed Father enjoys music.

136
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:42,080
And I've met a musician named Bua Sai.

137
00:18:42,080 --> 00:18:45,480
She's with the troupe performing
at the City Longevity Ceremony.

138
00:18:45,480 --> 00:18:50,280
She's very talented,
and there's something intriguing about her.

139
00:19:21,480 --> 00:19:23,160
Yes, Your Highness.

140
00:19:24,040 --> 00:19:29,240
I'm sure Prince Fah Haam will choose wisely.

141
00:20:41,600 --> 00:20:42,960
Dao Kaew.

142
00:20:51,480 --> 00:20:53,440
Don't you remember me?

143
00:20:58,120 --> 00:20:59,560
No.

144
00:21:03,200 --> 00:21:05,480
We met that night.

145
00:21:18,200 --> 00:21:22,400
I remember now. That drunkard.

146
00:21:25,480 --> 00:21:29,840
Our first meeting may not have gone very well,

147
00:21:29,840 --> 00:21:31,920
but I'm not always drunk.

148
00:21:34,120 --> 00:21:35,800
Wait.

149
00:21:38,240 --> 00:21:42,520
Aren't you curious who I am?

150
00:21:42,520 --> 00:21:44,000
Not at all.

151
00:22:19,360 --> 00:22:23,920
Did you ask Lady Homjan
to have me teach you music, Your Highness?

152
00:22:25,480 --> 00:22:26,760
Yes.

153
00:22:27,680 --> 00:22:32,600
I simply wanted to see how skilled you are.

154
00:22:35,640 --> 00:22:40,040
Or perhaps you just want to see me more often?

155
00:22:42,760 --> 00:22:44,600
You're...

156
00:22:45,480 --> 00:22:47,040
quite full of yourself.

157
00:22:48,760 --> 00:22:54,680
What else am I supposed to think?
If that's not the reason, then so be it.

158
00:22:54,680 --> 00:22:59,400
This is simply the way I am. I speak my mind.

159
00:23:00,760 --> 00:23:04,200
I don't like to conceal who I am.

160
00:23:12,560 --> 00:23:15,160
Would you stop rubbing that?

161
00:23:17,360 --> 00:23:21,600
I must keep reminding you,
so you won't do it again.

162
00:23:25,680 --> 00:23:30,080
Nevertheless, I thank you
for the job opportunity.

163
00:23:35,200 --> 00:23:40,120
I hope your skill with the fiddle
is as sharp as your tongue.

164
00:23:51,320 --> 00:23:55,960
I shall take that as a compliment,
Prince Fah Haam.

165
00:24:31,600 --> 00:24:34,040
Lha said you came to see me.

166
00:24:35,720 --> 00:24:37,640
What is it, Your Highness?

167
00:24:39,320 --> 00:24:43,960
Did Lady Homjan send you to fetch me?

168
00:24:45,640 --> 00:24:47,800
I brought you some lotus tea.

169
00:24:51,800 --> 00:24:53,560
For me?

170
00:24:53,560 --> 00:24:54,720
Yes.

171
00:24:57,480 --> 00:24:59,120
So you can make tea for me.

172
00:25:00,360 --> 00:25:03,640
So I can make tea for you?

173
00:25:03,640 --> 00:25:04,880
Exactly.

174
00:25:05,560 --> 00:25:07,520
I made the tea myself.

175
00:25:07,520 --> 00:25:12,760
It soothes the mind, strengthens the heart,
and brings peaceful sleep.

176
00:25:14,680 --> 00:25:19,880
You currently have many matters
weighing on your mind,

177
00:25:19,880 --> 00:25:22,000
especially concerning your cousin.

178
00:25:24,360 --> 00:25:28,200
So you're allowed to have some.

179
00:25:44,280 --> 00:25:48,320
Death is never far away.
You should learn to prepare for it.

180
00:25:48,320 --> 00:25:50,800
Why must you speak so ominously
about my cousin?

181
00:25:50,800 --> 00:25:52,680
I'm merely speaking the truth.

182
00:25:53,480 --> 00:25:59,080
We all must face death one day.
It is inevitable.

183
00:25:59,080 --> 00:26:01,240
We must learn to accept it.

184
00:26:06,880 --> 00:26:08,960
You've been taking care of others.

185
00:26:09,800 --> 00:26:12,000
Don't forget to take care of yourself as well.

186
00:26:14,320 --> 00:26:17,240
Your cousin holds you dear, does she not?

187
00:26:23,280 --> 00:26:27,600
Then what if I drink all of this?

188
00:26:30,240 --> 00:26:31,720
That's quite all right.

189
00:26:33,840 --> 00:26:35,920
I'll make you some more.

190
00:26:35,920 --> 00:26:42,440
So, whose tea is this, exactly?
Yours or mine?

191
00:26:42,440 --> 00:26:46,960
It's mine, but you may have some.

192
00:26:48,720 --> 00:26:50,480
Let me know when you've finished it.

193
00:26:52,520 --> 00:26:54,160
Prince Mueang Fah.

194
00:26:58,760 --> 00:27:00,320
Thank you.

195
00:27:24,640 --> 00:27:27,040
I never knew you had this side to you.

196
00:27:29,080 --> 00:27:32,440
Lady Fongnuan! Lady Fongnuan!

197
00:27:33,520 --> 00:27:35,960
Princess Maneethip's condition
has grown very grave.

198
00:27:49,360 --> 00:27:51,160
Hold on a little longer.

199
00:27:51,160 --> 00:27:54,840
I've ordered medicine to be prepared
and brought to you.

200
00:27:56,280 --> 00:27:58,240
It's all right.

201
00:27:59,600 --> 00:28:02,280
I'm no longer in pain.

202
00:28:03,760 --> 00:28:06,360
I'm not suffering anymore.

203
00:28:11,680 --> 00:28:14,000
I'm the reason you're in this state.

204
00:28:17,200 --> 00:28:19,360
About General In Saeng...

205
00:28:22,160 --> 00:28:23,720
I'm sorry.

206
00:28:26,880 --> 00:28:29,920
It wasn't your fault.

207
00:28:33,840 --> 00:28:36,000
It's my fault...

208
00:28:37,480 --> 00:28:39,880
that In Saeng died.

209
00:28:43,480 --> 00:28:46,520
I'm the one who should apologize.

210
00:28:49,240 --> 00:28:54,680
I've ruined your life
and the life of the man I loved.

211
00:28:57,640 --> 00:29:01,240
If I hadn't been born
a princess of Wang Nam Lin,

212
00:29:02,840 --> 00:29:05,520
none of this would've happened.

213
00:29:08,840 --> 00:29:11,440
But I've never once regretted...

214
00:29:14,640 --> 00:29:17,240
loving you in this lifetime.

215
00:29:26,680 --> 00:29:28,760
Thank you...

216
00:29:31,880 --> 00:29:34,840
for loving me.

217
00:29:36,440 --> 00:29:41,960
I'm sorry I couldn't be worthy of your love.

218
00:29:41,960 --> 00:29:47,560
I hope you find someone...

219
00:29:49,720 --> 00:29:52,720
who deserves your love.

220
00:30:11,720 --> 00:30:16,880
There's one more thing I'd like to ask of you.

221
00:30:16,880 --> 00:30:19,960
Fongnuan has no one but me.

222
00:30:21,000 --> 00:30:23,560
From now on,

223
00:30:25,320 --> 00:30:28,720
will you look after her in my place?

224
00:30:32,280 --> 00:30:35,000
She may seem strong,

225
00:30:36,240 --> 00:30:41,680
but she's much more fragile than she lets on.

226
00:30:42,720 --> 00:30:45,200
She has such a tender heart.

227
00:30:48,440 --> 00:30:54,440
Please be there to comfort her...

228
00:30:57,000 --> 00:30:59,880
and help her through this grief.

229
00:31:01,480 --> 00:31:03,080
I promise...

230
00:31:05,160 --> 00:31:07,960
I'll take care of Fongnuan for you.

231
00:31:11,000 --> 00:31:13,080
Thank you.

232
00:31:17,160 --> 00:31:19,160
I'm sorry...

233
00:32:55,320 --> 00:32:57,000
Cousin.

234
00:33:11,520 --> 00:33:13,360
Cousin.

235
00:34:18,600 --> 00:34:22,400
Royal Consort Chiang La-or will arrange
the funeral as soon as possible.

236
00:34:22,400 --> 00:34:27,840
Princess Maneethip's ashes will be sent
to Wang Nam Lin, as she requested.

237
00:34:30,600 --> 00:34:34,600
What about Fongnuan? How is she?

238
00:34:34,600 --> 00:34:36,400
I don't know, Your Highness.

239
00:34:37,320 --> 00:34:39,200
I haven't heard anything about her.

240
00:34:48,680 --> 00:34:50,800
I'll go back to see Fongnuan.

241
00:34:52,280 --> 00:34:54,480
See to the arrangements here, Muen In.

242
00:34:55,520 --> 00:34:56,800
Yes, Your Highness.

243
00:36:26,400 --> 00:36:27,880
Saen Thep,

244
00:36:29,280 --> 00:36:32,040
see the Chief of City Affairs
and the Chief of Palace Affairs out.

245
00:37:04,760 --> 00:37:07,480
Though your cousin is gone,

246
00:37:07,480 --> 00:37:12,880
you'll always have a place
at Chiang La-or Residence, Fongnuan.

247
00:37:15,000 --> 00:37:19,000
My doors will always be open to you.

248
00:37:23,000 --> 00:37:24,760
Thank you, Your Highness.

249
00:37:54,080 --> 00:37:58,200
It'll be all right.
You still have both of us by your side.

250
00:38:00,320 --> 00:38:02,960
Thank you, Your Highnesses.

251
00:38:04,160 --> 00:38:08,280
Whenever you want to play the lute
to ease your grief, just let me know.

252
00:38:09,880 --> 00:38:11,480
Thank you.

253
00:38:17,280 --> 00:38:19,600
We'd better be going.

254
00:38:20,840 --> 00:38:22,720
You'll get through this.

255
00:38:25,360 --> 00:38:27,240
Thank you for coming.

256
00:39:31,840 --> 00:39:34,520
So that was your favorite daughter-in-law.

257
00:39:34,520 --> 00:39:38,840
You hoped her marriage would bring us...

258
00:39:38,840 --> 00:39:43,240
greater power and influence,
but things didn't go as planned.

259
00:39:43,240 --> 00:39:46,520
What do we do now?

260
00:39:47,880 --> 00:39:53,320
Maneethip wasn't the only woman
from Wang Nam Lin, was she?

261
00:39:59,240 --> 00:40:04,360
Do you really want Fongnuan
to become Saen Thep's consort?

262
00:40:05,880 --> 00:40:10,480
Better she becomes your
younger brother's wife than your father's.

263
00:40:16,240 --> 00:40:20,480
You're the one pushing Saen Thep
to become King.

264
00:40:20,480 --> 00:40:25,640
If he marries her,
she'll become his Royal Consort.

265
00:40:26,960 --> 00:40:32,760
And if he falls deeply in love with her,
she'll become Queen.

266
00:40:32,760 --> 00:40:36,560
So be it.
Better that than having her as an enemy.

267
00:40:39,320 --> 00:40:43,600
If Fongnuan wins your father's trust...

268
00:40:43,600 --> 00:40:46,600
and helps Saen Thep ascend the throne,

269
00:40:46,600 --> 00:40:48,680
then as his elder sister,

270
00:40:48,680 --> 00:40:53,240
you should be happy for him,
not raise your voice at me.

271
00:41:29,320 --> 00:41:30,840
Fongnuan.

272
00:41:35,080 --> 00:41:38,560
Fongnuan? Who?

273
00:41:38,560 --> 00:41:43,000
Your name is Fongnuan. My name is Maneethip.

274
00:41:43,000 --> 00:41:45,440
We're both from Wang Nam Lin.

275
00:41:47,680 --> 00:41:52,960
Fongnuan! Fongnuan!

276
00:41:55,480 --> 00:41:59,200
If anything happened to you, what would I do?

277
00:42:01,680 --> 00:42:02,880
Wait.

278
00:42:02,880 --> 00:42:06,560
It's bad luck to bite into rice like that.
Roll it into a bite-sized ball first.

279
00:42:06,560 --> 00:42:09,000
I'll remember that.

280
00:42:13,120 --> 00:42:15,200
Please take care of my cousin, Your Highness.

281
00:43:00,840 --> 00:43:03,320
Don't cry.

282
00:43:06,160 --> 00:43:08,440
Your cousin is free now.

283
00:43:10,120 --> 00:43:12,920
Ever since I left home,

284
00:43:14,000 --> 00:43:18,200
Maneethip was the only one by my side.

285
00:43:18,200 --> 00:43:23,800
She made me feel
as though I still had family here.

286
00:43:32,960 --> 00:43:34,880
Your cousin...

287
00:43:36,680 --> 00:43:39,040
loved you dearly and worried about you so much.

288
00:43:39,040 --> 00:43:43,480
She wanted you to be strong and happy.

289
00:43:44,240 --> 00:43:49,120
Can you do that for her,
so she can rest in peace?

290
00:43:58,880 --> 00:44:04,400
You must promise me something, too.

291
00:44:04,400 --> 00:44:06,880
Take good care of yourself.

292
00:44:07,640 --> 00:44:12,440
I'm sure Maneethip
would've wanted you to be happy, too.

293
00:44:18,760 --> 00:44:20,360
I promise.

294
00:44:40,840 --> 00:44:42,440
Your Highness,

295
00:44:44,560 --> 00:44:49,560
there's something I'd like
to ask your help with.

296
00:45:01,920 --> 00:45:04,600
You're all gathered here.

297
00:45:05,400 --> 00:45:07,400
What's going on?

298
00:45:09,240 --> 00:45:11,200
Lady Homjan,

299
00:45:11,200 --> 00:45:15,800
could you take Lha in
as a lady-in-waiting at Wiang Kaew?

300
00:45:23,480 --> 00:45:26,120
Maneethip has just passed away.

301
00:45:26,120 --> 00:45:28,400
Fongnuan is working here,

302
00:45:29,480 --> 00:45:32,160
and Lha has been left all alone.

303
00:45:32,800 --> 00:45:34,480
If you don't take her in,

304
00:45:34,480 --> 00:45:37,880
Royal Consort Chiang La-or may send her
back to Wang Nam Lin.

305
00:45:38,640 --> 00:45:43,880
So that's what you've all come
to discuss with me?

306
00:45:45,600 --> 00:45:50,200
Please let Lha work here, my lady.

307
00:45:50,200 --> 00:45:53,560
She can help you with your duties,
just as I do.

308
00:45:55,000 --> 00:45:57,720
I'm willing to learn anything.

309
00:45:57,720 --> 00:46:00,400
I can help in the kitchen,

310
00:46:00,400 --> 00:46:04,720
fetch water, cook rice, or chop firewood.

311
00:46:04,720 --> 00:46:07,160
I can do it all.

312
00:46:07,160 --> 00:46:09,440
Fongnuan has just lost her cousin.

313
00:46:09,440 --> 00:46:13,440
Would you really make her lose
someone else close to her?

314
00:46:20,040 --> 00:46:24,760
Surely our Mother Homjan isn't that heartless?

315
00:46:27,120 --> 00:46:30,040
I'm not exactly a kind person.

316
00:46:30,040 --> 00:46:35,240
If you weren't,
you wouldn't have taken in orphans like us.

317
00:46:35,240 --> 00:46:40,280
I took you two in to spare
His Majesty any more headaches.

318
00:46:41,080 --> 00:46:45,440
Do you have any idea
how much trouble you two cause?

319
00:46:46,720 --> 00:46:52,720
You've already put up with Kong Tai,
Fah Haam, and Fongnuan.

320
00:46:56,400 --> 00:46:58,840
Please be kind to Lha, too.

321
00:47:12,880 --> 00:47:14,800
Very well.

322
00:47:21,640 --> 00:47:25,320
Thank you, my lady. Thank you so much.

323
00:47:25,320 --> 00:47:27,640
I'm deeply grateful to you all,
Your Highnesses.

324
00:47:31,720 --> 00:47:35,760
Come with me.
I'll show you where you'll be staying.

325
00:47:35,760 --> 00:47:37,040
Yes, my lady.

326
00:47:48,000 --> 00:47:51,680
You needn't worry about Lha
being sent back to Wang Nam Lin.

327
00:47:51,680 --> 00:47:53,800
I'll speak to my mother.

328
00:47:53,800 --> 00:47:55,440
Thank you, Your Highness.

329
00:48:07,560 --> 00:48:09,880
Thank you both, too.

330
00:48:09,880 --> 00:48:12,760
Seeing you smile puts our minds at ease.

331
00:48:12,760 --> 00:48:18,000
I'll never forget your kindness
for as long as I live.

332
00:48:18,720 --> 00:48:23,760
I'll be strong and become my old self again.

333
00:48:27,240 --> 00:48:29,280
So, where's Senior?

334
00:48:29,280 --> 00:48:34,120
I haven't seen him since the funeral.

335
00:49:20,800 --> 00:49:23,720
I'm sorry about your cousin.

336
00:49:26,560 --> 00:49:29,200
Thank you for your kindness, Your Majesty.

337
00:49:29,960 --> 00:49:32,160
I've come to terms with her passing.

338
00:49:33,080 --> 00:49:34,760
We all...

339
00:49:36,560 --> 00:49:39,240
- must face death one day.
- Must face death one day.

340
00:49:39,240 --> 00:49:43,280
It's inevitable. We must learn to accept it.

341
00:49:44,880 --> 00:49:47,320
I've learned to accept it, Your Majesty.

342
00:49:52,680 --> 00:49:55,000
You're wise beyond your years.

343
00:49:55,640 --> 00:49:57,760
Where did you learn such wisdom?

344
00:50:03,640 --> 00:50:06,240
Prince Mueang Fah taught me, Your Majesty.

345
00:51:01,720 --> 00:51:05,480
How are you holding up
since your cousin passed away?

346
00:51:06,440 --> 00:51:07,680
Is that all you wanted to ask?

347
00:51:07,680 --> 00:51:09,720
You could've just come over
and asked me nicely.

348
00:51:09,720 --> 00:51:12,480
You startled me.

349
00:51:12,480 --> 00:51:14,000
Are you going to answer me or not?

350
00:51:14,000 --> 00:51:16,200
As you said,

351
00:51:16,200 --> 00:51:21,160
death is inevitable, and we must accept it.

352
00:51:21,160 --> 00:51:23,880
I'm starting to come to terms with it.

353
00:51:26,480 --> 00:51:27,640
Good.

354
00:51:28,360 --> 00:51:34,520
The sooner you accept her passing,
the sooner your cousin can rest in peace.

355
00:51:34,520 --> 00:51:39,560
Is that all? I'm sleepy. I'll be going now.

356
00:51:39,560 --> 00:51:40,840
Wait.

357
00:51:46,360 --> 00:51:50,000
Let me know when you've finished your tea.

358
00:51:51,960 --> 00:51:53,720
I'll make you a fresh pot.

359
00:52:38,000 --> 00:52:40,160
- Senior!
- Junior.

360
00:52:50,800 --> 00:52:52,200
Junior.

361
00:52:53,160 --> 00:52:54,880
How are you?

362
00:52:55,840 --> 00:52:57,760
I'm okay.

363
00:52:58,520 --> 00:53:00,080
Okay?

364
00:53:00,960 --> 00:53:05,120
I'm doing all right. I feel much better now.

365
00:53:07,800 --> 00:53:11,160
I came back as soon as I heard the news.

366
00:53:12,160 --> 00:53:14,480
Did you come straight from the border?

367
00:53:18,000 --> 00:53:21,720
I came as quickly as I could,
but I was still too late.

368
00:53:23,120 --> 00:53:28,360
I'm so sorry I wasn't there for you
when you were suffering.

369
00:53:29,400 --> 00:53:31,440
It's really all right.

370
00:53:32,920 --> 00:53:38,200
Just knowing you care about me means a lot.

371
00:53:42,040 --> 00:53:47,640
Even though your cousin is gone,
you still have me, your Senior.

372
00:53:51,840 --> 00:53:53,920
Even when we're far apart,

373
00:53:57,120 --> 00:53:59,720
I'll always be there for you.

374
00:54:02,880 --> 00:54:08,880
From now on, I'll take good care of you.

375
00:54:12,560 --> 00:54:14,320
Thank you, Your Highness.

376
00:54:17,200 --> 00:54:19,680
But first,

377
00:54:19,680 --> 00:54:24,600
if you really want to take care of me,
please leave for now.

378
00:54:25,560 --> 00:54:30,800
If anyone sees you hugging me,
it could cause trouble.

379
00:54:33,480 --> 00:54:37,400
You're right. It's getting late, too.

380
00:54:37,400 --> 00:54:43,240
If you need anything, let me know at once.

381
00:54:44,160 --> 00:54:45,320
All right.

382
00:54:47,160 --> 00:54:48,400
Deal?

383
00:54:53,480 --> 00:54:55,040
Deal.

384
00:55:04,520 --> 00:55:06,480
I'd better go now.

385
00:55:08,320 --> 00:55:10,120
See you later, Senior.

386
00:55:34,720 --> 00:55:38,200
I don't know what it feels like...

387
00:55:38,200 --> 00:55:41,760
to be attracted to someone or fall in love.

388
00:55:41,760 --> 00:55:45,200
You meet someone
you can't get out of your mind.

389
00:55:45,200 --> 00:55:49,200
Whether you're awake, asleep, or eating,
you keep thinking of her.

390
00:55:49,200 --> 00:55:53,240
Every time you see her,
your heart starts racing.

391
00:56:20,920 --> 00:56:22,440
Could this be...

392
00:56:23,520 --> 00:56:25,120
love?

393
00:58:37,520 --> 00:58:39,680
[Next Episode]
Father favors Indraraja above everyone else.

394
00:58:39,680 --> 00:58:43,640
Now that they're building a weir together,
he has even more chances to impress Father.

395
00:58:43,640 --> 00:58:46,560
You must help Jom Harn prove himself
to the King.

396
00:58:46,560 --> 00:58:49,640
I'll help him,
but only if Jom Harn asks me himself.

397
00:58:49,640 --> 00:58:51,600
Can't your own mother ask you for a favor?

398
00:58:51,600 --> 00:58:56,360
Don't call yourself my mother
unless you truly see me as your son.

399
00:58:57,040 --> 00:58:59,520
You laugh so freely with everyone else.

400
00:58:59,520 --> 00:59:01,120
Why do you always seem so afraid of me?

401
00:59:01,120 --> 00:59:04,000
The reason is obvious, Your Highness.

402
00:59:04,000 --> 00:59:06,360
Word has spread throughout Wiang Kaew

403
00:59:06,360 --> 00:59:10,040
that His Majesty places great trust
in Fongnuan.

404
00:59:10,040 --> 00:59:15,080
You must prove your worth soon,
before Father values her more than you.

405
00:59:15,080 --> 00:59:16,280
You should control yourself.

406
00:59:16,280 --> 00:59:21,800
Otherwise, others may realize
how desperately you want to become King.
